Initialization
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p f
atom_style      atomic
timestep        0.001

System Construction
lattice         bcc 1.0
region          simbox block 0 20 0 20 0 75 units box
create_box      1 simbox
region          projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units box
create_atoms    1 region projectile
region          target block 0 20 0 20 35 75 units box
create_atoms    1 region target
group           projectile region projectile
group           target region target

Potential
pair_style      eam
pair_coeff      * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

Miscellaneous
thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal press

Production Run
velocity        all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix             equil all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run             100000
unfix           equil
velocity        projectile set 0.0 0.0 20.0 sum yes units box
fix             impact all nve
run             100000